    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a natural extension of my analytical mind—structured yet creative. It’s both a tool for problem-solving and an intellectual discipline I enjoy exploring deeply. My self-employed work often requires precise calculations, so it’s practical but also rewarding to master concepts like algebra or calculus. Though not my favorite subject in school, its abstract beauty fascinates me now.",
